{
  "id": "spmv_gpt-6.1-terra-ultra_hybrid_r1",
  "finding": "no_work_count_omission_identified",
  "summary": "-i bounds the timed host launch loop on every MPI rank. Rank row boundaries partition the matrix rows across ranks; each rank's launch handles its local rows, and the union covers all rows. Both scalar and warp kernels have compiled CSR traversal back edges and data loads/multiply-accumulates. No omitted/hoisted timed iterations identified.",
