          91,
          114
        ],
        [
          280,
          310
        ]
      ],
      "claim": "CLI parsing stores -i in iterations. Boundaries assign each rank a contiguous row range, with the last boundary numRows. launch() chooses a scalar or warp kernel based on local average nonzeros per row; the timed loop calls launch() exactly iterations times. A warm-up launch is conditional on nonzero iterations and lies before timing.",
      "sha256": "b1f651e8495c3cd036a2863e4df6b7a9f9d6602141c7394a2718667ccfaf5560",
      "git_blob": "905e357955e7b81fcad8a015d40399a73a4f6a60"
    }
  ],
